## Enhanced Implementation Continuation Strategy

### 1. Determine Current Phase and State

```typescript
// Read implementation progress
read_file("[planning_folder_path]/implementation-progress.md", should_read_entire_file=true)

// Analyze phase and step information
const currentPhase = extractPhaseFromProgress(progress)
const currentStep = extractStepFromProgress(progress)
const completedSteps = extractCompletedStepsFromProgress(progress)

// Check for continuation markers
const hasContinuationPoints = progressContainsContinuationPoints(progress)
const lastContinuationPoint = extractLastContinuationPoint(progress)

// Update implementation progress with new continuation point
edit_file("[planning_folder_path]/implementation-progress.md",
          "Update implementation progress with new continuation point",
          "// ... existing content ...\n\n## Continuation Point\n- Date: [current date]\n- Continuing from: Phase [currentPhase], Step [currentStep]\n- Continuation Count: [updated count]\n\n// ... existing content ...")
```

### 2. Enhanced Document Analysis Strategy

```typescript
// Determine target documentation files based on implementation phase
const targetDocumentationFiles = determineTargetFiles(currentPhase, progress)

// Read and analyze each target file
for (const file of targetDocumentationFiles) {
  read_file(file, should_read_entire_file=true)
  
  // For each documentation file, identify rules-workflow components to verify against
  const referencedComponents = extractReferencedComponents(file)
  
  // Analyze rules-workflow implementation for each referenced component
  for (const component of referencedComponents) {
    read_file(`1000xbrain/workflows/rules-workflow/${component.path}`, should_read_entire_file=true)
    
    // Verify patterns match implementation
    const patternMatches = comparePatternWithImplementation(file, component)
    
    // Track verification results
    updateVerificationTracking(component, patternMatches)
  }
}
```

